1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:05,400
Ten years on, another life, another shore

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:10,560
I don't think about the fights anymore

3
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:15,980
I think about the roads, and the beaches we found

4
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:22,380
Sitting side by side while the sun went down

5
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:27,340
Five a.m. at Hua Hin, the sea as calm as glass

6
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:33,340
So beautiful, we'd swim before the town woke up

7
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:37,860
Fruit from the market in a plastic bag

8
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:43,020
We'd eat it on the motorbike, and that was enough

9
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:50,260
We were fire and fire, we could burn the whole night down

10
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:54,340
Then water, the calmest sea around

11
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:57,760
Ten years on, another life, another shore

12
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:04,220
I don't think about the fights anymore

13
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:09,660
I think about the roads, and the beaches we found

14
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:14,640
Sitting side by side while the sun went down

15
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:20,200
And every year they light the candles, and I think of you

16
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:23,620
'Cause it's your birthday too

17
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:29,600
Riding down the coastline on the motorbike

18
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:32,200
Any makeshift room would do for the night

19
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:34,240
We had next to nothing, and we had it all

20
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:37,160
Another empty beach, watching the sun fall

21
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,440
We could do it cheap, we could do it grand

22
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:42,300
You were just as happy with a street-food stand

23
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:45,420
A few drinks deep, then home, and you'd put Faded on

24
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,460
We'd be asleep before the end of the song

25
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:52,520
We were fire and fire, I can still feel the heat

26
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:57,560
Then water, that's the part I keep

27
00:01:57,640 --> 00:02:00,640
Ten years on, another life, another shore

28
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:07,000
I don't think about the fights anymore

29
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:12,540
I think about the roads, and the beaches we found

30
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:17,440
Sitting side by side while the sun went down

31
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:23,020
And every year they light the candles, and I think of you

32
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:26,460
'Cause it's your birthday too

33
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:33,040
I was the one who left, and it broke me too

34
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:38,280
It's the hardest thing I've ever had to do

35
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:44,280
I've lived a lot since, and I'll tell you something true

36
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:48,960
Nobody's ever come close to you

37
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:54,040
I'm in Australia now, I built a life, I'm fine

38
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:59,260
I'm not asking for you back, I'm not rewriting time

39
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:05,320
But if this ever finds you, wherever you are

40
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:10,120
You'll know it's you, you were the best of it, by far

41
